.TH TULPAR-LIST 1 "2026" "tulpar 0.2.0" "Tulpar Manual"
.SH NAME
tulpar-list \- list installed packages
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tulpar list
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B tulpar l
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B tulpar \-l
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lists every package recorded in the package database, with its
installed version and hold state.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-dest " " \fIpath\fR
List the database of an alternate root.
.TP
.BR \-j ", " \-\-json
Print the package list as a JSON array instead of human-readable
text.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tulpar (1),
.BR tulpar-search (1),
.BR tulpar-info (1)
